{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1045214/block/singleImage/3167159/df/01KZ1Y0BNVF31KR642FB4SACF4.jpg?updatedAt=1785697734\"/><figcaption>(林俊源攝)</figcaption></figure><p>昨日為「全民運動日」，行政長官李家超身穿運動服，在文化體育及旅遊局長羅淑佩等官員陪同下，到九龍公園體育館參與手球互動項目及足球虛擬運動，又觀賞武術表演和全民健體操示範。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T01:27:26.275670+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"}}